<title>USA: TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SAMPRAS WINS U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top seed Pete Sampras beat second-seeded fellow American Michael Chang 6-1 6-4 7-6 (7-3) to win the U.S. Open men's singles title on Sunday.</p>
</text>
